  - Standalone ARM64 Android host architecture (com.ce.ide / com.ce.dev,
    10-byte prefix parity, zero PRoot, zero Electron, zero Termux dependency)
    running OpenAI's official Codex VS Code Extension (openai.chatgpt
    v26.51111.21308) paired with the native static ARM64 codex CLI
    (0.169.0-alpha.11.1) and codex-code-mode-host directly on Android silicon.
  - O(1) indexed asset archive (webview-bundle.pak) serving 15,350 pre-indexed
    webview modules in < 2 ms without 15k-inode mobile storage extraction.
  - Capability-hardened local security stack: per-boot 256-bit loopback host
    authentication (CE_AUTH_TOKEN, HttpOnly SameSite=Strict cookies, X-CE-Token
    headers, HMAC-SHA256 health-probe challenge), Host/Origin DNS-rebinding &
    CSRF defenses, and strict credential/filesystem confinement.
  - Native inline composer workspace switcher with Android Storage Access
    Framework (SAF) directory picker and live per-session working directory
    synchronization.
  - 1-Tap Native Android ARM64 MCP Plugins & Official Skills Hub wiring live
    into ~/.codex/config.toml (config/mcpServer/reload) and ~/.agents/skills
    for 9 native ARM64 MCP suites (Craft Anything + Ghidra 12.1.4, ADB &
    Shizuku Bridge, GitHub Native ARM64, Game Studio 2D/3D, Unity Studio
    Android, Video Studio Pro, AI Video Generator, Chrome DevTools MCP, and
    Android SDK & CLI Skills).
  - Native ARM64 Rust multicall userspace (ce-box: parallel pkg manager,
    ce-daemon scheduler, ce-fix-paths, ce-notify), Gradle-free deterministic
